# W44-147: photo cluster per-strategy + per-region SSIM2 audit
#
# Phase 1 investigation per W44-146 ranked candidate #1 (photo SSIM2
# recovery, HIGH EV, MED risk, 3-5d). Measurement only; no production
# code change.
#
# === TL;DR ===
#
# Three distinct sub-mechanisms across the photo SSIM2 deficit cluster:
#
#   A. 1418519 e7/e8 d=5/6 (SSIM2 -2.17 to -2.57): strategy + qac at
#      PARITY (98.8% agreement, identical Y-channel tokens, identical
#      first-block counts). Mechanism is downstream — pure buttloop
#      reconstruction / EPF / metric divergence. SAME mechanism W44-138
#      identified (+0.034 R max-abs at after_epf). W44-139 already
#      HONEST-STOPPED on 4 cells; W44-147 confirms the mechanism is
#      load-bearing on the broader 1418519 cluster (6 of 6 1418519 cells
#      d>=5 share this pattern).
#
#   B. 1420710 e6-e9 d=5/6 (SSIM2 -2.11 to -2.13): cost-model
#      over-prefers DCT32X32 over smaller transforms (DCT16X32 /
#      DCT16X16 / DCT32X16). 88.4% agreement, Y-tokens at parity (+94).
#      W44-96/98 already lift DCT32X32 entropy_mul for this image —
#      but the lift admits MORE DCT32X32, not less, which is the
#      WRONG direction per W44-147. The W44-98 fix was tuned for cells
#      where 1420710 was UNDER-picking DCT32X32 (e8 d=5/6). At d=6/e6
#      it now OVER-picks.
#
#   C. 1531677 e5-e7 d=3/5/6 (SSIM2 -1.17 to -2.00): same mechanism as
#      B but more severe — at e5 d=3 strategy agreement drops to 70.7%
#      and ours picks DCT32X32 where cjxl picks 16× DCT8 (252-cell
#      disagreement on DCT32X32 → DCT8 alone). 1531677 e7 d=5 is the
#      MOST ACTIONABLE cell on the entire photo cluster (top of the
#      at-parity-bytes list, SSIM2 -2.00, bytes +0.53%).
#
# Top 3 Phase 2 candidates ranked in memory note. NO production source
# touched. Hash-locks unchanged.
#
